1) Demon lords will pick up the amulet if you leave it lying around
2) Demon lords will teleport to the up-stairs to heal, even on non-
teleport levels, and even when they have the "AoY.
3) If you hurt them while they are standing on the upstairs, they
will flee upstairs.  Make sure there are no trapdoors nearby, they
might try to jump through those instead.  They can also use wands
of digging to create their own.  They will never be blocked by
the "mysterious force", except if they attempt to levelport.
4) To reach the upstairs quickly on most non-teleport levels, you
can levelport to the level above, teleport to the down-stairs, and
then climb down.  This of course assumes that the level above is
not non-teleport.  Therefore, the wizard's tower levels will still
require some time.
5) When you want the "AoY back, just whack the demon with your
   cockatrice corpse.
6) You don't really need to use stoning on the demon lord, but it
   can make things easier.

